1
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,630
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,790
♪All worldly pursuits are fleeting
dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,350
♪Sorrow fades away, resentment fades
away♪

4
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,870
♪Anger and grudges are but passing
clouds♪

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,640
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:30,150
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,230
♪This humble monk wanders freely across
the land♪

8
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,430
♪Laughing and fooling around, yet bound
by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:43,950
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:47,110
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,230
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit of
wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,580
♪But in the end, all things simply pass
by♪

13
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,350
♪Better to follow the heart and find
true joy♪

14
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:00,550
♪Don't let worldly troubles bind your
soul♪

15
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,190
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,870
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,430
♪With my worn-out fan in hand, I care
not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,750
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,510
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:13,910
♪Simple robes and straw sandals beat
fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:17,070
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple fan
is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:20,470
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot of
wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:23,750
♪Wine and meat may pass through me, but
kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:27,030
♪I cling not to appearances, finding
freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:29,070
♪I travel north and south, witnessing
the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,540
♪I see life's joys and sorrows in a
single glance♪

27
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:36,150
♪Those who harm the good and abuse their
power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:39,630
♪Do good and cultivate virtue, and
worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,990
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:45,750
♪True cultivation lies in a joyful
heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,870
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:52,990
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:56,380
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 8=

34
00:01:58,620 --> 00:01:59,060
You...

35
00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:01,260
You're that Taoist from years ago.

36
00:02:01,940 --> 00:02:02,700
That's right.

37
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:04,980
Your husband, Huang Shilang,

38
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:07,100
truly wanted to save you back then.

39
00:02:08,220 --> 00:02:09,140
Dear!

40
00:02:12,700 --> 00:02:13,620
How could this happen?

41
00:02:14,100 --> 00:02:15,260
What did you give me?

42
00:02:16,740 --> 00:02:19,100
Your wife is a Ruifu bird spirit.

43
00:02:19,540 --> 00:02:21,020
Feed her human blood,

44
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:23,100
and she'll produce endless riches.

45
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:25,180
A fortune that great

46
00:02:26,100 --> 00:02:27,620
was too good to pass up.

47
00:02:28,740 --> 00:02:30,260
After all our years of friendship,

48
00:02:31,820 --> 00:02:33,340
why would you do this to me?

49
00:02:33,620 --> 00:02:34,900
A human marrying a demon?

50
00:02:35,340 --> 00:02:37,060
You deserved to die.

51
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:54,540
Dear!

52
00:02:57,500 --> 00:03:00,060
Dear!

53
00:03:04,300 --> 00:03:05,220
I never expected

54
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:07,060
you to come back to life.

55
00:03:07,900 --> 00:03:10,140
You thought Huang Shilang killed you.

56
00:03:10,820 --> 00:03:11,780
To get revenge,

57
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:14,620
you even gave up your inner core.

58
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:17,420
What a fool.

59
00:03:19,220 --> 00:03:20,340
How did you know it was me?

60
00:03:21,460 --> 00:03:23,260
I'd heard the stories.

61
00:03:24,020 --> 00:03:25,540
That monk may act crazy,

62
00:03:26,220 --> 00:03:27,780
but he's an Arhat reincarnate.

63
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:29,620
There's no way

64
00:03:30,460 --> 00:03:31,380
he'd use sorcery on me

65
00:03:31,380 --> 00:03:32,540
over a little money.

66
00:03:33,140 --> 00:03:34,820
If it wasn't the monk,

67
00:03:35,140 --> 00:03:36,980
and you wanted revenge on Huang Shilang,

68
00:03:37,460 --> 00:03:39,140
then it could only be you.

69
00:03:39,740 --> 00:03:40,260
Evil Taoist!

70
00:03:40,660 --> 00:03:42,300
Even with my inner core,

71
00:03:42,860 --> 00:03:44,220
you'll never become an immortal.

72
00:03:46,700 --> 00:03:48,700
An ordinary mortal couldn't.

73
00:03:49,340 --> 00:03:50,340
For years,

74
00:03:50,460 --> 00:03:51,620
I've lived in luxury,

75
00:03:51,620 --> 00:03:52,820
with wealth beyond measure.

76
00:03:53,420 --> 00:03:54,980
The only thing I want

77
00:03:54,980 --> 00:03:56,540
is eternal life

78
00:03:56,540 --> 00:03:57,780
and true immortality.

79
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:58,660
What?

80
00:03:58,660 --> 00:03:59,220
That's why

81
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:00,740
I devoted myself to cultivation

82
00:04:00,740 --> 00:04:01,740
and mastered Taoist arts.

83
00:04:02,780 --> 00:04:04,220
Absorbing your inner core

84
00:04:04,940 --> 00:04:06,580
will be child's play.

85
00:04:07,940 --> 00:04:08,420
No.

86
00:04:08,660 --> 00:04:09,140
No!

87
00:04:33,180 --> 00:04:34,400
Didn't you want to use my son

88
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:35,660
as the final ingredient?

89
00:04:35,900 --> 00:04:37,300
Here's another secret.

90
00:04:37,540 --> 00:04:39,140
He's actually

91
00:04:39,980 --> 00:04:42,020
the son you had with Huang Shilang.

92
00:04:43,060 --> 00:04:43,540
You...

93
00:04:44,620 --> 00:04:45,660
What did you say?

94
00:04:45,940 --> 00:04:48,300
I planned to wait until he married

95
00:04:48,700 --> 00:04:50,220
and fathered a demon child,

96
00:04:50,620 --> 00:04:52,380
then absorb them both.

97
00:04:53,260 --> 00:04:56,020
Now that I've absorbed your inner core,

98
00:04:56,540 --> 00:04:57,860
I'll live forever

99
00:04:57,860 --> 00:04:58,900
and reach the Immortal Realm.

100
00:05:00,940 --> 00:05:02,140
Die!

101
00:05:04,380 --> 00:05:05,980
Su Ling'er!

102
00:05:10,300 --> 00:05:10,780
Go!

103
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:18,900
Are you okay?

104
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:20,900
Why didn't you kill him?

105
00:05:22,140 --> 00:05:23,420
If I kill him now,

106
00:05:23,620 --> 00:05:24,980
I can't rescue my savior.

107
00:05:26,100 --> 00:05:27,860
I have to save my son.

108
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:30,860
Without your inner core,

109
00:05:30,860 --> 00:05:31,780
your power has waned.

110
00:05:31,780 --> 00:05:32,660
And you've been poisoned.

111
00:05:32,780 --> 00:05:34,740
You'll die if this continues.

112
00:05:36,580 --> 00:05:37,580
My head...

113
00:05:37,820 --> 00:05:38,260
Head?

114
00:05:39,020 --> 00:05:39,820
What's wrong with it?

115
00:05:40,820 --> 00:05:41,620
Does it hurt?

116
00:05:42,380 --> 00:05:43,780
Find my other head.

117
00:05:44,100 --> 00:05:45,300
Okay.

118
00:05:56,300 --> 00:05:57,000
Once I've absorbed

119
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,700
that demon and your son,

120
00:05:59,100 --> 00:06:00,420
I'll deal with you.

121
00:06:01,100 --> 00:06:01,980
Taoist Master.

122
00:06:06,660 --> 00:06:07,140
Father.

123
00:06:08,340 --> 00:06:09,540
You little brat.

124
00:06:10,140 --> 00:06:11,460
Weren't you locked up?

125
00:06:11,980 --> 00:06:12,860
How'd you get out?

126
00:06:13,180 --> 00:06:14,740
I let him out.

127
00:06:15,660 --> 00:06:16,100
Father,

128
00:06:16,300 --> 00:06:17,420
where's the Taoist Master?

129
00:06:17,620 --> 00:06:18,420
The Taoist Master?

130
00:06:19,060 --> 00:06:20,460
He ascended to immortality.

131
00:06:20,460 --> 00:06:20,980
What?

132
00:06:20,980 --> 00:06:21,500
Then...

133
00:06:21,900 --> 00:06:22,820
Then my wife...

134
00:06:23,220 --> 00:06:24,580
Did he absorb her too?

135
00:06:25,900 --> 00:06:28,580
That little demon is right here.

136
00:06:29,300 --> 00:06:30,460
Hey.

137
00:06:31,180 --> 00:06:32,620
You little brat.

138
00:06:32,620 --> 00:06:34,820
You're always running around with men

139
00:06:34,820 --> 00:06:36,380
or hanging around demons.

140
00:06:36,380 --> 00:06:37,860
Are you trying to kill me?

141
00:06:37,860 --> 00:06:38,260
Huh?

142
00:06:39,100 --> 00:06:39,660
Father,

143
00:06:39,940 --> 00:06:40,820
I'm begging you.

144
00:06:41,300 --> 00:06:42,460
Please let my wife go.

145
00:06:42,660 --> 00:06:43,820
You're not even married.

146
00:06:43,820 --> 00:06:44,820
Don't call her your wife.

147
00:06:44,980 --> 00:06:45,660
Father,

148
00:06:46,500 --> 00:06:46,860
I...

149
00:06:47,260 --> 00:06:48,860
I've already slept with her.

150
00:06:48,980 --> 00:06:49,700
She might

151
00:06:49,860 --> 00:06:51,500
already be carrying your grandchild.

152
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:52,660
Enough with that.

153
00:06:53,300 --> 00:06:54,620
Even then, it'd be a demon child.

154
00:06:55,140 --> 00:06:55,700
Father.

155
00:06:57,020 --> 00:06:58,180
Let her go right now.

156
00:07:00,500 --> 00:07:01,780
Otherwise...

157
00:07:07,620 --> 00:07:08,780
I'll kill myself.

158
00:07:09,100 --> 00:07:09,620
Hey!

159
00:07:09,820 --> 00:07:10,220
You...

160
00:07:10,540 --> 00:07:11,500
Say what you want,

161
00:07:11,500 --> 00:07:13,780
but why smash my teapot?

162
00:07:13,860 --> 00:07:14,740
Oh, my!

163
00:07:14,740 --> 00:07:15,700
If I die,

164
00:07:16,140 --> 00:07:17,380
the child she's carrying

165
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:19,420
will be your only descendant.

166
00:07:19,420 --> 00:07:21,260
I know you'll let her go.

167
00:07:25,420 --> 00:07:28,540
You're just as foolish as your father.

168
00:07:29,180 --> 00:07:31,260
You actually fell for a demon.

169
00:07:40,820 --> 00:07:41,700
Lüdie!

170
00:07:44,420 --> 00:07:45,260
Are you okay?

171
00:07:47,980 --> 00:07:48,900
Thank you, Father.

172
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:49,380
Mm.

173
00:07:50,620 --> 00:07:51,740
He's not your father.

174
00:07:52,700 --> 00:07:54,380
I heard it all from inside the gourd.

175
00:07:54,860 --> 00:07:56,700
He killed your real father long ago.

176
00:07:56,940 --> 00:07:58,020
What are you talking about?

177
00:07:58,220 --> 00:07:59,620
She's right.

178
00:08:03,540 --> 00:08:04,660
Who are you?

179
00:08:04,660 --> 00:08:06,220
Why do you look like my father?

180
00:08:06,500 --> 00:08:07,940
He didn't just kill your father.

181
00:08:08,140 --> 00:08:09,620
He also took your mother's inner core.

182
00:08:10,220 --> 00:08:12,020
You're next.

183
00:08:12,140 --> 00:08:13,020
What?

184
00:08:13,820 --> 00:08:15,580
My... my mother?

185
00:08:16,140 --> 00:08:17,260
You're not my father?

186
00:08:17,500 --> 00:08:18,500
Hey.

187
00:08:18,780 --> 00:08:19,940
I'm not his father,

188
00:08:20,540 --> 00:08:21,940
but you're my own son.

189
00:08:21,940 --> 00:08:22,660
Why be afraid?

190
00:08:22,660 --> 00:08:23,460
- Oh.
- Hurry!

191
00:08:24,940 --> 00:08:25,380
Stop!

192
00:08:27,500 --> 00:08:28,180
Die!

193
00:08:29,580 --> 00:08:30,380
Who's yelling?

194
00:08:31,100 --> 00:08:31,580
Hmm?

195
00:08:31,820 --> 00:08:32,300
Ah!

196
00:08:36,900 --> 00:08:38,980
You were already hurt in the gourd.

197
00:08:39,460 --> 00:08:41,620
You're no match for me.

198
00:08:42,460 --> 00:08:43,580
Right now,

199
00:08:43,580 --> 00:08:45,780
I'll drain all your spiritual power.

200
00:08:47,540 --> 00:08:48,580
No!

201
00:08:48,580 --> 00:08:49,460
Oh.

202
00:08:49,940 --> 00:08:50,620
Fine.

203
00:08:52,060 --> 00:08:55,100
I raised you all these years.

204
00:08:55,100 --> 00:08:57,020
So I'll give you one chance.

205
00:08:57,500 --> 00:08:59,140
You want to save this little demon?

206
00:09:00,690 --> 00:09:01,160
Mm.

207
00:09:02,980 --> 00:09:04,220
Do it yourself.

208
00:09:04,660 --> 00:09:07,020
Cut out your heart and give it to me.

209
00:09:07,620 --> 00:09:09,340
Then I'll spare her life.

210
00:09:09,980 --> 00:09:10,740
What?

211
00:09:11,780 --> 00:09:12,420
Don't!

212
00:09:12,420 --> 00:09:13,300
Even if you do,

213
00:09:13,300 --> 00:09:14,660
he won't let me live.

214
00:09:15,260 --> 00:09:17,220
Then you can die together!

215
00:09:17,460 --> 00:09:18,380
Stop!

216
00:09:23,060 --> 00:09:23,860
No, no!

217
00:09:24,540 --> 00:09:25,060
Don't!

218
00:09:29,380 --> 00:09:30,420
Stop!

219
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:35,220
Don't!

220
00:09:39,660 --> 00:09:40,460
Don't!

221
00:09:42,180 --> 00:09:43,500
Why are you doing this?

222
00:09:44,620 --> 00:09:45,540
Die,

223
00:09:46,260 --> 00:09:48,220
you got dragged into this because of me.

224
00:09:52,900 --> 00:09:54,780
From the moment I saw you yesterday,

225
00:09:55,580 --> 00:09:57,140
I may have been acting,

226
00:09:58,500 --> 00:09:59,900
but one thing I said was true.

227
00:10:01,820 --> 00:10:02,780
I have

228
00:10:04,460 --> 00:10:06,220
never seen a girl so adorable.

229
00:10:07,660 --> 00:10:08,660
I meant that.

230
00:10:09,980 --> 00:10:10,660
Later,

231
00:10:11,460 --> 00:10:13,100
I learned you were a demon.

232
00:10:14,260 --> 00:10:15,260
But I believe

233
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:18,820
you're a good one.

234
00:10:20,180 --> 00:10:21,660
I wanted more time

235
00:10:23,980 --> 00:10:25,620
to spend with you.

236
00:10:27,980 --> 00:10:29,060
If I were lucky,

237
00:10:30,580 --> 00:10:31,620
I wanted us

238
00:10:34,620 --> 00:10:36,260
to spend our lives together.

239
00:10:38,100 --> 00:10:38,980
Die,

240
00:10:40,740 --> 00:10:41,980
if my life today

241
00:10:45,580 --> 00:10:46,740
can save yours,

242
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:50,180
then I...

243
00:10:54,420 --> 00:10:56,420
can die happy.

244
00:10:58,620 --> 00:11:00,020
No! No!

245
00:11:02,860 --> 00:11:03,740
No!

246
00:11:04,020 --> 00:11:04,860
No!

247
00:11:09,580 --> 00:11:10,940
I found your other head.

248
00:11:23,580 --> 00:11:24,420
How are you?

249
00:11:24,420 --> 00:11:25,500
Are you okay?

250
00:11:36,620 --> 00:11:36,900
You...

251
00:11:37,140 --> 00:11:37,940
What are you doing?

252
00:11:38,780 --> 00:11:40,260
You may know the fox clan's sorcery,

253
00:11:40,980 --> 00:11:42,340
but you're still inexperienced.

254
00:11:42,860 --> 00:11:44,220
I'm borrowing your spiritual power

255
00:11:44,220 --> 00:11:45,220
to kill that evil Taoist

256
00:11:45,220 --> 00:11:46,260
and save my son.

257
00:11:46,380 --> 00:11:47,300
If you kill him,

258
00:11:47,300 --> 00:11:48,580
what about my savior?

259
00:11:52,380 --> 00:11:53,380
My son comes first now.

260
00:11:53,380 --> 00:11:54,620
I can't worry about anything else.

261
00:11:56,900 --> 00:11:57,500
Hey!

262
00:12:09,540 --> 00:12:10,980
Actually, I like you too.

263
00:12:11,500 --> 00:12:13,020
I worried about what Piaopiao said,

264
00:12:13,020 --> 00:12:14,300
that I'm a demon and you're human.

265
00:12:14,300 --> 00:12:16,180
But now that I know the truth,

266
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:17,700
I won't let you die.

267
00:12:24,140 --> 00:12:25,180
Evil Taoist!

268
00:12:25,460 --> 00:12:27,180
My master is Elder Jigong.

269
00:12:27,180 --> 00:12:28,820
If you absorb our spiritual power,

270
00:12:28,820 --> 00:12:30,820
he'll wipe you out completely,

271
00:12:30,820 --> 00:12:32,500
and you'll never reincarnate.

272
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:33,180
Yeah, right.

273
00:12:34,540 --> 00:12:36,118
That rotten monk

274
00:12:36,119 --> 00:12:37,500
is still locked up in jail.

275
00:12:38,060 --> 00:12:39,300
By the time he finds out,

276
00:12:39,540 --> 00:12:41,860
I'll have drained all your power

277
00:12:41,860 --> 00:12:43,460
and become an immortal.

278
00:12:43,900 --> 00:12:45,980
Piaopiao and I share a psychic bond.

279
00:12:46,540 --> 00:12:47,940
In an instant,

280
00:12:47,940 --> 00:12:49,380
she can receive my message.

281
00:12:51,540 --> 00:12:52,140
Piaopiao!

282
00:12:52,620 --> 00:12:53,740
That evil Taoist is posing as Mr. Huang!

283
00:12:53,740 --> 00:12:54,660
He's draining our power!

284
00:12:54,660 --> 00:12:55,660
Bring Master here to save me!

285
00:12:56,740 --> 00:12:59,100
Elder Jigong will be here any moment.

286
00:13:05,540 --> 00:13:06,420
Sir.

287
00:13:06,740 --> 00:13:08,180
Whatever mistakes he's made,

288
00:13:08,180 --> 00:13:09,580
he's still your son.

289
00:13:09,780 --> 00:13:11,380
Please don't scold him anymore.

290
00:13:11,860 --> 00:13:12,140
Here.

291
00:13:12,380 --> 00:13:13,740
Have some tea and calm down.

292
00:13:13,820 --> 00:13:14,540
Get out!

293
00:13:14,540 --> 00:13:15,060
Huh?

294
00:13:15,500 --> 00:13:16,220
Right away!

295
00:13:18,420 --> 00:13:21,220
So much for your psychic bond.

296
00:13:23,100 --> 00:13:24,380
Let's see

297
00:13:24,660 --> 00:13:26,380
who can save you today.

298
00:13:30,260 --> 00:13:32,020
Didn't I tell you to get out?

299
00:13:32,340 --> 00:13:32,620
You...

300
00:13:33,700 --> 00:13:35,100
Who dares lay a hand on my disciple?

301
00:13:41,700 --> 00:13:44,750
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

302
00:13:45,100 --> 00:13:47,950
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

303
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:51,750
♪Everything I own is worn and
weathered♪

304
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:54,830
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

305
00:13:55,240 --> 00:14:01,990
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

306
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:05,550
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

307
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:15,470
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

308
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:18,710
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

309
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:22,030
♪After the wedding, I became an
immortal♪

310
00:14:22,040 --> 00:14:23,710
♪I thought of the Arhat who subdued the
tiger♪

311
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:25,630
♪And there he was, right by my side, oh
my♪

312
00:14:25,640 --> 00:14:27,190
♪I left my wife behind♪

313
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:28,790
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

314
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:32,630
♪Living a life of hiding here and
running there♪

315
00:14:32,640 --> 00:14:33,750
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

316
00:14:33,760 --> 00:14:35,870
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

317
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:37,550
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

318
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:39,430
♪Waiter, bring me a plate of chicken
wings♪

319
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:42,790
♪People laugh and say I'm lost and
foolish♪

320
00:14:42,800 --> 00:14:46,070
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

321
00:14:46,280 --> 00:14:49,190
♪His endless lectures come from worry
I'll cause trouble♪

322
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:52,550
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

323
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:56,230
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

324
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:59,590
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

325
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:02,670
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

326
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:06,310
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

327
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:09,750
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

328
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:13,310
♪You chase fame and fight over fortune
and fate♪

329
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:16,790
♪You're just wasting your time♪

330
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:19,750
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

331
00:15:19,760 --> 00:15:21,430
♪And I just laugh happily♪

332
00:15:21,440 --> 00:15:24,830
♪Wishing joy and happiness for all in
this world♪

